# THE DEUTERONOMY WALK sitting 18 — CHAPTERS 26-28 (LEAN, 2026-09-26): chapter 26's Sifrei rows TYPED, piska 301 rows 1-18 (on 26:5-8 — the recital): the response in
# the holy tongue by 27:14's analogy, the prompting of all, LABAN THE ARAMEAN, the descent to sojourn with seventy, distinguished in Egypt, the affliction and the toil
